---
import '../../styles/trades-launch.css';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Twistor Trades — Every request. A clear next step.</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Twistor Trades connects residents, property teams, and trusted service providers in one place. Every request has a clear next step. Prelaunch preview." />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#091526" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="shell masthead">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Twistor home"><span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">t</span> twistor<span class="brand-product">/ trades</span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a class="nav-cta" href="#concept">How it works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main">
      <section class="shell hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal" aria-hidden="true"></span> PROPERTY MAINTENANCE. CONNECTED.</p>
          <h1 id="hero-title">Every request.<br/><span>A clear next step.</span></h1>
          <p class="lede">Property maintenance moves forward—from the first report to the finished job.</p>
          <p class="hero-detail">Twistor Trades connects residents, property teams, and trusted service providers in one place.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions"><button class="button primary" type="button" disabled aria-describedby="signup-opening">Get early access <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><button class="provider-link" type="button" disabled aria-describedby="signup-opening">Bring your trade business <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div>
          <p class="release-note" id="signup-opening">PRELAUNCH PREVIEW · REGISTRATION IS CLOSED</p>
        </div>
        <div class="visual" id="concept" role="region" aria-label="Illustrative maintenance workflow" tabindex="-1">
          <div class="orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class="dispatch-panel">
            <div class="panel-top"><span class="mini-brand">TWISTOR / TRADE VIEW</span><span class="sample-pill">SAMPLE REQUEST</span></div>
            <div class="panel-heading"><div><p class="small-label">PROPERTY MAINTENANCE</p><h2>Leaking kitchen faucet</h2></div><span class="trade-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div>
            <p class="location">Sample property · Unit 204 · Routine plumbing</p>
            <ol class="journey"><li class="done"><span>01</span><div><strong>Resident reports the issue</strong><small>Details and availability stay together.</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li><li class="done"><span>02</span><div><strong>Manager approves the work</strong><small>Scope and budget guide the job.</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">✓</b></li><li class="active"><span>03</span><div><strong>Provider accepts the job</strong><small>One team takes responsibility.</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b></li><li><span>04</span><div><strong>Manager confirms completion</strong><small>Photos and work details support review.</small></div><b aria-hidden="true">○</b></li></ol>
            <div class="panel-bottom">ONE REQUEST. EVERY STEP TOGETHER.</div>
          </div>
          <div class="floating-label"><span aria-hidden="true">⌁</span> From reported to resolved.</div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
